# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
# Description: Detects the execution of WMIC in order to get a list of firewall and antivirus products
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*Product*) AND ((process.executable:*\\wmic.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"wmic.exe"))) AND NOT ((((process.command_line:* uninstall* OR process.command_line:* install*)) OR (process.command_line:*csproduct*))))
